SUMMARY:Understanding Local AI Use
LOCATION:South Philadelphia Library
DESCRIPTION:AI presents real-world concerns around labor\, mental health\, 
 cognition\, climate\, privacy\, and misinformation. In this session\, Alis
 on Macrina of Library Freedom Project will provide an overview of what's h
 appening with technology and data centers in your community. She'll share 
 resources for getting plugged into local efforts to resist and shape AI us
