  you can learn to save a life. \n Average time it takes someone to bleed t
 o death: 3 - 5 minutes\n\nAverage time for first responders to arrive: 7 -
  10 minutes\n\nTrauma-related deaths worldwide due to bleeding: 40%\n Part
 icipants will receive formal Stop the Bleed training\, which includes a pr
 esentation followed by hands-on practice of applying direct pressure\, pac
 king a wound\, and using a tourniquet to stop bleeding. Certificates will 
 be…\n\nhttps://libwww.freelibrary.org/calendar/event/170204
